+
+The earlier covenant wording is also carried accurately in chapter 28: nothing made to happen; only inside a fight somebody else begins; cost on paper first; followed by the Norhold cost amendment and four initials.
+
+## Source reuse
+
+**Pass on the supplied overlap result:** 0 unprotected shared runs of eight or more words; 11 protected runs, allowed. No prose-reuse finding is warranted.
+
+Evidence note: `source-overlap.summary` contains that 0/11 result, while the referenced `source-overlap.tsv` is currently zero-length. The run-by-run protected list therefore cannot be reproduced from the TSV artifact in this pass. Manual checking of the movement's protected wording still passes.
+
+## Numerical formula alignment
+
+### Method and coverage
+
+Coverage is chapters 28–34 only. The supplied results come from `editions/monroe-1.3/tools/formula_metrics.py`; they are used here without re-estimation. The script strips H1 headings and marked scene breaks, removes emphasis markers, counts fenced system-notice words but excludes them from sentence/readability statistics, treats each nonempty manuscript line as a written paragraph, and counts marked breaks plus chapter boundaries as scenes. Sentences split at terminal punctuation followed by whitespace and a capital/opening quote, with ellipses and common abbreviations protected. Syllables use a vowel-group heuristic with silent-*e* and -*le* adjustments; proper names and system terms are estimated like ordinary words and can bias readability.
+
+| Measure | Formula target | Coordinator working range | Observed | Assessment |
+|---|---:|---:|---:|---|
