+| Sentences | — | — | 2,701 | Coverage count |
+| Sentence mean | 14.6 | 13–15.5 | 13.2 | Passes range; 1.4 below exact target |
+| Sentence median | 11 | — | 9 | Short of target |
+| Sentence population SD | ~26 | — | 11.67 | Material shortfall in breadth; cadence is much less widely distributed than selected formula |
+| Sentences ≤5 words | 27.7% | up to ~34% | 31.3% | Passes range; short beats run hot against exact target |
+| Sentences ≥40 words | 3.3% | 2.5–4.5% | 4.2% | Passes primary range |
+| Written paragraph mean | 26.8 ASR proxy | Directional | 39.01 | Longer than proxy; do not equate written paragraphs with ASR pauses |
+| Written paragraph median | ~18 ASR proxy | up to ~30 | 28 | Passes adopted range, near its upper edge |
